{"id":"ca27ed9f018939eb","group":"92","path":"92/92-lem-weak-to-strong-function-definition.md","title":"Strengthening a Weak Function Definition","display":"lem-weak-to-strong-function-definition — Strengthening a Weak Function Definition","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-lem-weak-to-strong-function-definition","aliases":["92-lem-weak-to-strong-function-definition"],"display":"lem-weak-to-strong-function-definition — Strengthening a Weak Function Definition","source":"第 VIII 章 pp. 101–102，Lemma（PDF 118–119）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-finite-order-system]]","[[92-df-strongly-definable-function]]","[[92-df-formula-instance]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-lem-weak-to-strong-function-definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-lem-weak-to-strong-function-definition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-weak-to-strong-function-definition — Strengthening a Weak Function Definition"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VIII 章 pp. 101–102，Lemma（PDF 118–119）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a769d89316a99993\" href=\"?note=a769d89316a99993\" title=\"92-df-finite-order-system\">92-df-finite-order-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"be5eece035332f0c\" href=\"?note=be5eece035332f0c\" title=\"92-df-strongly-definable-function\">92-df-strongly-definable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8bd18c4d476f594a\" href=\"?note=8bd18c4d476f594a\" title=\"92-df-formula-instance\">92-df-formula-instance</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>；\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K=F\\land\\forall v_2\\bigl(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(F;v_0,v_2)\\to v_1\\leq v_2\\bigr)\">\\(K=F\\land\\forall v_2\\bigl(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(F;v_0,v_2)\\to v_1\\leq v_2\\bigr)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeakDef}_{\\mathcal S},\\mathrm{StrongDef}_{\\mathcal S}\">\\(\\mathrm{WeakDef}_{\\mathcal S},\\mathrm{StrongDef}_{\\mathcal S}\\)</span> 为上游弱、强函数定义关系。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinOrder}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FinOrder}_G\\)</span> 是<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a769d89316a99993\" href=\"?note=a769d89316a99993\" title=\"92-df-finite-order-system\">92-df-finite-order-system</a>的有限初始段与数码比较性质。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}weak\\text{-}to\\text{-}strong\\text{-}function\\text{-}definition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FinOrder}_G(\\mathcal S)\\land\\mathrm{WeakDef}_{\\mathcal S}(F,f)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{StrongDef}_{\\mathcal S}(K,f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}weak\\text{-}to\\text{-}strong\\text{-}function\\text{-}definition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FinOrder}_G(\\mathcal S)\\land\\mathrm{WeakDef}_{\\mathcal S}(F,f)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{StrongDef}_{\\mathcal S}(K,f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=f(n)\">\\(m=f(n)\\)</span>。弱定义给正图实例及所有错误输出的负图实例。有限初始段和比较性使系统证明任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(n,z)\">\\(F(n,z)\\)</span> 输出必满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar m\\leq z\">\\(\\bar m\\leq z\\)</span>；因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(n,m)\">\\(K(n,m)\\)</span> 可证。错误标准输出的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 实例由其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 合取项可反驳。</p>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(n,y)\">\\(K(n,y)\\)</span> 及已知 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(n,m)\">\\(F(n,m)\\)</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\leq\\bar m\">\\(y\\leq\\bar m\\)</span>。有限初始段把候选输出化为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,\\ldots,m\">\\(0,\\ldots,m\\)</span>；小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 的候选均由错误图实例排除，只剩 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y=\\bar m\">\\(y=\\bar m\\)</span>。全称化得到逐输入强唯一性。它证明有强定义见证，不声称原来的任意弱定义公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 已有此唯一性。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VIII 章 pp. 101–102，Lemma（PDF 118–119）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-finite-order-system","status":"resolved","id":"a769d89316a99993","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-finite-order-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-strongly-definable-function","status":"resolved","id":"be5eece035332f0c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-strongly-definable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula-instance","status":"resolved","id":"8bd18c4d476f594a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula-instance]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-finite-order-system","status":"resolved","id":"a769d89316a99993","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinOrder}_G$ 是[[92-df-finite-order-system]]的有限初始段与数码比较性质。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"K=F\\land\\forall v_2\\bigl(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(F;v_0,v_2)\\to v_1\\leq v_2\\bigr)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WeakDef}_{\\mathcal S},\\mathrm{StrongDef}_{\\mathcal S}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinOrder}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}weak\\text{-}to\\text{-}strong\\text{-}function\\text{-}definition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FinOrder}_G(\\mathcal S)\\land\\mathrm{WeakDef}_{\\mathcal S}(F,f)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{StrongDef}_{\\mathcal S}(K,f).","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"m=f(n)","display":false},{"tex":"F(n,z)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar m\\leq z","display":false},{"tex":"K(n,m)","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"K(n,y)","display":false},{"tex":"F(n,m)","display":false},{"tex":"y\\leq\\bar m","display":false},{"tex":"0,\\ldots,m","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"y=\\bar m","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false}],"bytes":2001,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-85","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-strongly-definable-function]] → [[92-thm-strong-definition-pullback]]；[[92-lem-weak-to-strong-function-definition]]利用有限序性质强化函数图定义。强可定义性对每个固定数码输入约束所有输出，不等于一个统一内部总性句。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-253","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-lem-weak-to-strong-function-definition]]"}],"outgoing":["a769d89316a99993","be5eece035332f0c","8bd18c4d476f594a"]}